// Shared.xcconfig — committed build settings shared by every machine (referenced
// from project.yml via configFiles).
//
// Why the split: the Apple Development team ID is machine-/owner-specific and must
// never be committed, so it lives in Local.xcconfig next to this file, which is
// gitignored. Create it once with scripts/set-team.sh. The #include? directive is
// OPTIONAL — on CI Local.xcconfig does not exist and the build runs unsigned
// (CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO), which is exactly what we want.

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
